I want to search the conditions for Cunningham chains of specific
lengths and demonstrate that chains of these lengths can be found
by searching through values which satisfy the conditions

To state differently:
I have determined conditions which are sufficient for chains of
specific length.  I need to explore values which satisfy these
conditions and examine rains for chains not being found. This
will hopefully lead to improvements on the conditions that are
necessary for chains of specific length

